      "asset": "art-02a"
    },
    {
      "id": "living-review-008",
      "section": 1,
      "cue": "So why does living alone feel",
      "headline": "WHY DOES IT COST SO MUCH?",
      "layout": "illustration",
      "asset": "art-01a"
    },
    {
      "id": "living-review-009",
      "section": 1,
      "cue": "Because, in several important ways,",
      "headline": "YOU ARE PAYING FOR A HOUSEHOLD.",
